      "source": "https://pabucketlist.com/exploring-the-abandoned-lime-kilns-at-canoe-creek-state-park/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Limestone quarried along Mary Ann’s Creek was hauled by cable to the kilns, where a brick furnace produced lime that cooled on concrete platforms.",
